parameters.text:
=Compile these conference CFP opportunities for an MS in AI applicant building their research publication record.

Research Topics: {{ $('Set CFP Config').item.json.research_topics }}
Paper Types: {{ $('Set CFP Config').item.json.paper_type }}

Top Conference CFPs:
{{ $('Search Top Conference CFPs').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Workshop CFPs:
{{ $('Search Workshop CFPs').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Return JSON:
{
  "urgent_cfps": [{"venue": "", "type": "", "deadline": "", "topics_match": "high/medium/low", "difficulty": "entry/intermediate/competitive", "url": ""}],
  "upcoming_cfps": [{"venue": "", "deadline": "", "opens": ""}],
  "best_for_first_publication": [{"venue": "", "reason": "", "deadline": ""}],
  "submission_strategy": "",
  "weekly_summary": "2-3 sentence summary"
}

=📝 *Conference CFP Update — {{ $now.toFormat('MMM dd') }}*

{{ $json.weekly_summary }}

*⚡ Submit Now (Urgent):*
{{ $json.urgent_cfps.filter(c=>c.topics_match==='high').slice(0,3).map(c=>`• ${c.venue} (${c.type}): Deadline ${c.deadline} — ${c.difficulty}`).join('\n') }}

*Best for First Publication:*
{{ $json.best_for_first_publication.slice(0,2).map(c=>`• ${c.venue}: ${c.reason}`).join('\n') }}

*Strategy:* {{ $json.submission_strategy }}
